/* A PROJECT'S NEEDS YOU is laid out as its hub is (review-flow.tsx): the
   page's whole width on the page's own ground, its name a label of the
   look, what waits as rows of Home's kind in the look's card, in the look's
   columns, and under it the ways on into the project as three doors in a
