   width), on the wallpaper: the hero (the page's one question, its box and
   starts, Your work beside them over soft rings), the path a change
   travels ("In the workshop now"), then Lately and Live by week side by
   side, and Private requests' quiet row for admins
   (features/dev-board/workshop/front-page.tsx). Below 700px of its own
   width it is one column: the hero stacks, the path runs down the left
