/* END OF STANDARD (WIP). */
/* ── THE LEFT MENU AND THE TOP BAR (20 Nov 2026: the standard look's too).
   Drawn for Standard (WIP) first, then given to the standard look.
   The menu is a filled panel at every size: a sidebar from 768px, headed by
   Homeroom's logotype, and the phone's bottom bar under it. The place you
   are on is a filled row; a row under the pointer wears a soft ground; a
   count is a disc. The top bar has no fill of its own: its words and
   buttons are the page's ink, on every page (a project's page too, which
   painted it in the community's colour). The fold button is inside the
   panel, first on the logo's line, and stays on that spot folded.
   EVERY VALUE IS A TOKEN, --wip-nav-*, declared once here in light and in
   dark. The menu's colours are the brand kit's in both looks; what the
   top bar wears is the page's own, so the standard look reads the shell's
