/* The slider. The switch sits at the foot of the picture, where a thumb
   pressing it covers the least of the shot. */
/* direction: ltr, in Arabic too. A screenshot does not mirror, and everything
   in here is laid out in its coordinates: the framed layers' translate and
   scale from their left edge, the close-ups' and the veil's boxes, the seam's
   translate and the clip behind it. compare.tsx's seam runs Before on the left,
   After on the right; the captions and the switch say the same. */
.rf-compare { direction: ltr; position: relative; overflow: hidden; touch-action: pan-y; user-select: none; -webkit-user-select: none; -webkit-touch-callout: none; outline: none; }
