/* Each side's caption is on a solid strip across the top of the picture,
   and the seam wipes it with the picture (phone review #27, 23 Nov 2026:
   printed over the screenshot under a shade, it collided with the shot's own
   heading). The switch is on a strip across the foot. compare.tsx places the
   screen between the two (CAP_STRIP, FOOT_STRIP), so neither covers it. The
   strips are the card's own ground, so they read as the picture's frame.
   No z-index: they paint in the slider's order, the After strip under the
