/* ── END ONE LOOK · MESSAGES AND THREADS ── */

/* ── ONE LOOK · A PROJECT'S HUB AND ITS REQUESTS ── */
/* A project's pages in the agreed look: its Hub (the hero, For you, Recently live, Top contributors), a request's page
   (its title card, the card of what was asked with its status row, How it got here, the replies' card) and, where they
   share these parts, Needs you and the Workshop. The phone's bar keeps the project's colour, with the white back disc
   and the place under the name. Everything here draws with the
   shared parts above; where an earlier, more specific rule of the page drew a part its own way, the rule here puts the
   part's values back. */

/* ── THE BAR ON A PHONE, ON A PROJECT'S PAGES ── The community's colour stays on the bar (DrawerUntint lays the
   plain bar over it only while it slides). Back is the plain white disc with an ink chevron and no edge; the name is
   17/600, the place under it 12/500 at 82%. The bell and the Homeroom menu stay where they are. */
